ine numbers using the  `--line_numbers` option, by pre-padding the values with spaces instead of using textual's automatic column resizing.\r\n\r\n- Changed linear search for inserting out-of-order log lines to use binary search using the `bisect` module.\r\n\r\n- Timestamp parsers that matched on milliseconds with 3 decimal places only now match on timestamps with 1-6 decimal places."}
